# Date fields (KoyaKart)

Do **not** use raw `<input type="date">` in buyer, vendor, delivery, or super-admin apps.

Use **`PickerDateField`** from `@hlm-dates` (`web/shared/dates/PickerDateField.tsx`):

- Tap/click anywhere on the control opens the native calendar (`showPicker` when supported).
- Input is **`readOnly`** — users must not type or edit the date inline.
- Super-admin **`TextField`** with `type="date"` already delegates to `PickerDateField`.

Report date ranges should use **`DateRangePresetBar`** (also uses `PickerDateField` for From/To).
